  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      315.93,
      451.13,
      334.1
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 205 of the Civil Procedure Code (Chapter 101)and the legal effect of this section as amended is to provide for-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      156.67,
      346.17,
      451.17,
      374.42
    ],
    "text": "(a)the issuance of one certified copy of the judgement or final decree of an actionto each party free of charge, where the respective parties to such action applyfor the same; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      156.67,
      386.37,
      451.17,
      414.74
    ],
    "text": "(b)the recongnition of a document issued or transmitted by a court electronically,as signed and sealed documents and the electronic signature of the Registrar,court and other authorized officers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      209.49,
      168.35,
      401.69,
      178.45
    ],
