    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.77,
      233.73,
      394.05,
      243.73
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CIVIL PROCEDURE CODE (CHAPTER 101)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      261.21,
      401.84,
      284.89
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      302.15,
      401.86,
      325.93
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Civil Procedure Code(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      343.31,
      401.86,
      380.77
    ],
    "text": "2. The Civil Procedure Code (Chapter 101) is herebyamended by the repeal of section 205 thereof and substitutiontherefor of the following section:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      398.03,
      401.85,
      462.97
    ],
    "text": "205. (1) The Registrar of the court shall,where the respective parties to an action applyfor a certified copy of the judgement or finaldecree of the action, issue one certified copyof the same to each such party free of charge.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      480.33,
      401.89,
      517.81
    ],
    "text": "(2) Subject to the provisions of subsection(1), the Registrar of the court shall, upon anyperson-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      237.57,
      535.07,
      401.86,
      668.41
    ],
    "text": "(a) making an application accompaniedby such fee as may be determinedfrom time to time by the Secretary tothe Ministry of the Minister assignedthe subject of Justice by Notificationpublished in the Gazette andsupplying the necessary stamps,furnish to such person copies of thejudgement, decree or proceedings inan action or any part thereof; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      303.9,
      441.57,
      311.9
    ],
    "text": "Short title",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      343.62,
      451.29,
      380.42
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section205 ofChapter 101",
    "fonts": [
